OL,3,GNEWSAYouths seen at Full Monty club
OL,4,Abefore fire - police
OL,5,
OL,6,FYouths were reportedly seen entering a
OL,7,FSheffield working men's club which
OL,8,Ffeatured in 1997 film The Full Monty
OL,9,Fjust before a fire broke out, police
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FThe blaze began at Shiregreen Working
OL,13,FMen's Club on Shiregreen Lane just
OL,14,Fbefore 16:45 BST on Sunday 9 August,
OL,15,Fand South Yorkshire Police believe the
OL,16,Ffire was started deliberately.
OL,18,FIn an updated appeal, the force said:
OL,19,F"Following house-to-house inquiries, it
OL,20,Fis reported that a group of youths had
OL,21,Fentered the building and left seconds
OL,22,Fbefore the fire started."
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
